title: Checkout payment
description: A sequence diagram: who talks to whom, in order. Dashed arrows are replies.

sequence pay: Pay for an order {
  shopper: Shopper [person]
  web: Checkout page
  api: Orders API
  psp: Payment provider [cloud]
  shopper -> web: Pay €42
  web -> api: POST /orders/42/pay
  api -> psp: create payment intent
  psp ..> api: intent + client secret
  api ..> web: client secret
  web -> psp: confirm card (3-D Secure)
  psp ..> web: succeeded
  psp -> api: webhook payment.succeeded
  api -> api: mark order paid
  web ..> shopper: Thank you page
}
